":{"value":"hu:Dencey","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table class=\"licensetpl\" style=\"display:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"licensetpl_short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_link_req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl_attr_req\">false</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; clear: both; margin: 0.5em auto; background-color: var(--background-color-progressive-subtle, #f7f8ff); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: var(--border-subtle, 2px solid #8888aa); border-spacing: 8px; padding: 0px;\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"wpImageAnnotatorControl wpImageAnnotatorOff\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/250px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\"></span></span></div>\n</td>\n<td>This file depicts the official coat of arms or flag of a Hungarian municipality. According to 1.§ (4) of the Hungarian copyright law (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sztnh.gov.hu/sites/default/files/szjt_lxxvi_1999_en_rev_1.pdf\">1999./LXXVI.</a>), copyright protection does not cover \"legal provisions, other means of state direction, court and other official resolutions, announcements and documents issued by an authority or other official organ, as well as standards made obligatory by law and other similar regulations.\" Official coat of arms and flags, being defined in such a regulation, are thus in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:public domain\">public domain</a> in Hungary, and also in the US, according to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://copyright.gov/comp3/chapter300.html\" href=\"https://copyright.gov/comp3/chapter300.html\">§ 313.6(C)(2)</a> <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Compendium_of_U.S._Copyright_Office_Practices\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Compendium of U.S. Copyright Office Practices\">Compendium of U.S. Copyright Office Practices</a>, 3rd ed. 2014</i> (<i>Compendium (Third)</i>): \"As a matter of longstanding public policy, the U.S. Copyright Office will not register a government edict that has been issued by any state, local, or territorial government, including legislative enactments, judicial decisions, administrative rulings, public ordinances, or similar types of official legal materials. Likewise, the Office will not register a government edict issued by any foreign government or any translation prepared by a government employee acting within the course of his or her official duties.\"\n<p><b>Note:</b> The usage of coats of arms and flags is governed by legal restrictions, independent of the copyright status of the depiction shown here.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:x-small;line-height:140%\" class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/de\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/de\">Deutsch</a> | <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/en\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/en\">English</a> | <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/hu\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/hu\">magyar</a> | <small class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/lang&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Template:PD-Coa-Hungary/lang&amp;action=edit\">+/−</a></small></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"wpImageAnnotatorControl wpImageAnnotatorOff\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Flag_of_Hungary.svg/120px-Flag_of_Hungary.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Flag_of_Hungary.svg/250px-Flag_of_Hungary.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\"></span></span></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]},{"pageid":30415572,"ns":6,"title":"File:Memorial of the World War I. in Koszegszerdahely in Hungary.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2050267,"width":1944,"height":2592,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Memorial_of_the_World_War_I._in_Koszegszerdahely_in_Hungary.jpg/960px-Memorial_of_the_World_War_I._in_Koszegszerdahely_in_Hungary.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":800,"thumbheight":1067,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org